<title>USA: Data Systems Network wins Louisiana pact.</title>
<headline>Data Systems Network wins Louisiana pact.</headline>
<dateline>FARMINGTON HILLS, Mich. 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Data Systems Network Corp said on Tuesday it won a contract to provide computer networking services and products to the State of Louisiana.</p>
<p>The company said the 12-month agreement, which includes consultation, installation, configuration and design services, is expected to generate revenues of between $4 million and $5 million in 1997.</p>
<p>Data Systems provides computer network services.</p>
<p>Its shares were trading off 3-/8 Tuesday at 8-1/2.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
